<Transform translation="14.758 3.1 0.01"><Shape><Appearance><Material diffuseColor="0 0 0" emissiveColor="0.910 0.929 0.953"/></Appearance><Text string="&quot;Yes, your battery is still under warranty.&quot; &quot;Halden e-bike batteries are covered for 24&quot; &quot;months from the date of delivery, and order&quot; &quot;HB-20391 was delivered on 2025-05-12. If a&quot; &quot;service centre measures less than 70 percent&quot; &quot;of rated capacity, the battery is replaced&quot; &quot;free of charge. After approval, a&quot; &quot;replacement ships within 5 business days. To&quot; &quot;start, open a claim from the Orders page&quot; &quot;with your order number and the frame serial&quot; &quot;number.&quot;"><FontStyle family='"SANS"' style="PLAIN" size="0.120" spacing="1.18" justify='"BEGIN" "FIRST"'/></Text></Shape></Transform>
